    "summary": "ACCEPT. QR-18.1-01, QR-18.1-02 and QR-18.1-03 are resolved on the pinned candidate. Nested listing uses the held-root no-follow traversal and returns immediate Repository-relative children. Range reads compare observed file identity and metadata before disclosure. Queued List/Search waits link to context disposal, and the read open/use path checks disposal and returns sanitized Cancelled. The queued regressions protect accepted lifecycle behavior; focused RED, final 119/119 controlled Windows GREEN, clean convergence, current lookback and scoped lesson are recorded. Resource ownership, bounded budgets, authority timing, closed Agent schemas and affected module/test shape show no further required finding. The PostgreSQL-backed retained-source regressions remain blocked by missing VULGATA_STORY131_POSTGRES_ADMIN; controlled tests do not establish immutable snapshots or real Worker/model/provider integration."
